OL,3,GNEWSABottles made into Remembrance Day
OL,4,Atribute poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers have installed hundreds of
OL,7,Fpoppies made from plastic bottles ahead
OL,8,Fof Remembrance Day.
OL,10,FSt Michael & All Angels Church in
OL,11,FPirbright, Surrey asked for donations
OL,12,Fof bottles and enlisted the help of
OL,13,Fparishioners to turn them into the
OL,14,Fartificial flowers.
OL,16,FThe display is accompanied by a "ghost
OL,17,Fsoldier" sculpture.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
