OL,3,GNEWSABottles made into Remembrance Day
OL,4,Atribute poppies
OL,5,
OL,6,FReverend Joanna Day, a curate at the
OL,7,Fchurch, said the installation was
OL,8,F"inspired by the amazing displays at
OL,9,Fthe Tower of London and at other
OL,10,Fchurches around the country".
